<title>USA: Atlantic Central names new officers.</title>
<headline>Atlantic Central names new officers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlantic Central Enterprises Ltd said Thursday John E. McConnaughy Jr has been named chairman and Patrick J. Rooney will become president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Both men have been elected to the board, the company said.</p>
<p>They succeed Murray Watson, formerly chairman, president and chief executive officer, who will continue with the company as the president and chief executive of Atlantic Central's subsidiary company, ICON Centers for Cosmetic Surgery Inc.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
